id: pm-glossary-ci-v2
title: Apply Fleet CI v2 quick and arm64 deep tiers
description: Companion pm-cli-website-dyhg. Supersede local-routing PR #17 with hosted quick PR checks and arm64 deep gates; retain every original check.
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
