comments[16]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T14:53:49.119Z",codex-sol,"Required checks verified: test (22), test (26), codeql. Required CodeQL remains unfiltered. PR #17 is superseded by the new tier rollout; leave it open for owner disposition. Deep targets pm-local-arm64. Inspecting model depth, docs/pack/privacy inputs and process watchdogs."
  "2026-11-15T14:55:36.762Z",codex-sol,"Baseline main run 43653447844: Node 22 wall 45m48s including queue, 2m execution; Node 26 wall 54m52s including queue, 4m10s execution. Quick uses the original first 50 model sequences with generated-count assertions. Hardware-sensitive privacy CPU assertion replaced with twelve bounded adversarial iterations and a scaled runner watchdog. Product budgets unchanged. Cheap tier includes documentation/privacy, identity and actual packed inventory checks; packed acceptance already covers Bun and bunx."
  "2026-11-15T14:56:04.670Z",codex-sol,"Job-log API recovered timings after the combined run log was empty: full 500-sequence model 41.18s; packed acceptance 23.22s; full coverage test phases 54.47s and 54.07s on hosted Node 26. Typecheck and lint passed; strict unique-key YAML parsing passed; actionlint unavailable. Local touched quick suites are running; full depth remains deferred to deep CI."
  "2026-11-15T14:56:20.072Z",codex-sol,"All existing gate components remain in Node 26 quick and/or both deep release gates, including mutation probes, publish attestation, audit, duplication and packed consumers. New quick workflow retains required check names and cancellation; deep setup avoids cache downloads and Bun installation locally. Generated changelog updated for the task."
  "2026-11-15T14:57:26.046Z",codex-sol,Touched-suite validation exposed stale standalone-build workflow assumptions and a missing helper copy in an isolated identity fixture; both corrected. The health fixture now clears inherited PM settings before checking its own tracker. Quick coverage is running with unchanged thresholds. No product behavior changed.
  "2026-11-15T14:58:50.464Z",codex-sol,"PR #20 opened; required CI and CodeQL remain queued. Updated the behavioral revert probe from obsolete standalone CI step ordering to the Node 22 npm-test build prerequisite, preserving the clean-checkout regression proof. Packed acquisition already proves Bun/bunx. No bot/review threads changed."
  "2026-11-15T14:59:26.883Z",codex-sol,"Preserved the privacy start-anchor mutation proof: the twelve-case CPU harness budget is scaled rather than removed. This is a runner tolerance, not a published product deadline. The fixed operation count, privacy assertions and expected mutant failure remain intact."
  "2026-11-15T15:00:13.745Z",codex-sol,"First quick coverage invocation loaded the old build-step test before the correction: 141 of 142 tests passed, with only that obsolete assertion failing. Fixture/helper and health isolation corrections passed in that run. Corrected touched suites and behavioral revert probes are now being verified before a single coverage retry. Required PR checks remain queued."
  "2026-11-15T15:04:31.663Z",codex-sol,"Corrected touched quick suites passed through pm test in 146.76s, including model, process concurrency, docs/privacy, identity, tooling, clean build, real-data, health and helper tests. Final lint and test typecheck passed. Behavioral mutation corpus is progressing; coverage retry follows its completion to avoid concurrent writes to emitted files."
  "2026-11-15T15:07:50.411Z",codex-sol,"Behavioral revert corpus passed through pm test in 428.16s, including the scaled privacy start-anchor and Node 22 build prerequisite probes and the unchanged implementation controls. Corrected touched suites passed in 146.76s. Final quick coverage retry started with original 100 percent thresholds. No full-depth local run was performed."
  "2026-11-15T15:10:15.071Z",codex-sol,"Final quick coverage passed: 142 tests, 99.33s test phase, ten emitted production files, 100 percent statements/branches/functions/lines with no exclusions. Corrected touched suites passed in 146.76s and behavioral revert corpus in 428.16s. Hosted baseline full coverage test phases were 54.47s/54.07s on different hardware. PR #20 required jobs remain queued; no completed PR wall-time measurement. Claim released; item stays open for owner verification."
  "2026-11-15T15:40:55.754Z",codex-sol,"Cheap-path audit correction: build.test.ts reads tracked PM feature entries, and real-data.test.ts reads Markdown corpus fixtures. Added both to the docs/tracker command alongside review and identity suites. Both already passed in the final touched run and full quick coverage. No product code, thresholds, release workflows or release verifiers changed."
  "2026-11-15T15:42:46.288Z",codex-sol,"The corrected docs/tracker command passed through pm test in 51.28s: review, identity, tracker-linked build and Markdown corpus suites. Strict YAML parsing passed. Earlier quick coverage remains 142 tests at 100 percent in all four dimensions; source code and test files are unchanged by this correction. PR CI remains delegated to the owner without waiting."
  "2026-11-16T08:24:27.669Z",codex-sol,"Batch 2 template follow-up: split deep validation into Node 22/26 x npm/Bun with one conditional full release gate per job; preserve runner selection and full depth/time scale; disable deep cancellation; extend executable tracker/docs routing. Required CodeQL check remains unfiltered. Existing hosted-only npm cache restoration and Bun installation plus version logging already conform. Release callers, sync workflows, verifier scripts, protection and variables stay unchanged."
  "2026-11-16T08:29:03.415Z",codex-sol,"Latest successful PR run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/actions/runs/43813709734: Node 22/26 execution 1m03s/3m32s; created-to-completed including queue 6m43s/9m32s. Both executions fit the approximately 15-minute target, so item 6 needs no quick-depth or sharding change. Items 1, 2 and 5 changed; item 3 exempt because CodeQL is required; item 4 already conforms. Added strict unique-key YAML, one-gate matrix, runner setup and executable-path behavioral contracts."
  "2026-11-16T08:29:29.875Z",codex-sol,"Final local proof passed through pm test --run --only-last --progress: strict unique-key YAML parsing of every workflow, workflow contracts, npm run typecheck and npm run lint. actionlint is unavailable. Initial helper annotation/build setup issues were corrected before the passing rerun. No full-depth run attempted locally; deep certification remains after merge. PR observation is bounded to 30 minutes after the final push."
